    "enUS": {
      "description": "Just north of here lies the ruins of battles past. A dwindling scourge presence remains.\r\n\r\nThough the mindless undead are a threat themselves, the watchers maintain a vigilant eye on those entering the area, making removal of the scourge threat even more difficult.\r\n\r\nRemove the threat by taking from these watchers that which they value most.",
